OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThe odd morning shower is
OL,6,Fpossible in the east. Otherwise, a dry
OL,7,Fand bright day on Saturday with spells
OL,8,Fof sunshine. Feeling pleasant with
OL,9,Ftemperatures near average.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FA bright end to the day with
OL,12,Fsunny spells this evening. Mostly dry
OL,13,Fovernight with clear spells
OL,14,Fdeveloping. Chance of an isolated
OL,15,Fcoastal shower in the east of the
OL,16,Fregion.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
